// REJECTS: Unexpected token '<EOF>'
//
// An embedded-data island opened with #{ and never closed with }#. The parser must run to
// end-of-input and fail there rather than recovering at the enclosing brace.
//
// Island delimiters are where a hand-written parser is most likely to differ: the tempting
// implementation scans forward for the next '}' and treats the island as closed, which
// truncates the payload and produces a model that parses but is missing data.
###Data
Data fixture::neg::Unterminated
{
   ExternalFormat
   #{
      contentType: 'application/json';
      data: '{}';
}
